  MATIEC - IEC 61131-3 compiler


  The following compiler has been based on the
  FINAL DRAFT - IEC 61131-3, 2nd Ed. (2001-12-10)


  Copyright (C) 2003-2012  Mario de Sousa (msousa@fe.up.pt)


